## 2. PROJECT IDENTITY

Product name: Commit Pro.

Tagline: **Your Career. Your Roadmap. Your Next Commit.**

Mission: Help every student understand where they stand, which skills they need to develop, what they should practice today, and how close they are to becoming placement-ready.

Target users:
- First-time programmers.
- College students preparing for internships.
- Students targeting campus placements.
- Students preparing for off-campus software jobs.
- Students preparing for specific companies or technical roles.
- Students who need a structured plan instead of random preparation.
- Students who need to balance college work, exams, projects, and placements.

The product must not treat every user identically.

A beginner targeting a Java developer internship must receive a different roadmap from an experienced student targeting a full-stack role or an AI/ML position.

